── SYNTAX ERROR ─────────────────────────────── E0100_c_for_loop.lt:2:8  [E0100]

Stilt loops over a range, as `for i in 0..n`, or a list, as `for x in xs`:

  2 │   for (var i = 0; i < 3; i += 1) { print("{i}") }
    │        ^^^

A `for` loop takes each value of what follows `in`; a `while` loop runs while
its condition holds.
